                    "value": "Real & live: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Category and Total Tasks are observed from real Cowork activity. Estimated Value $ is modeled from that activity using cited time-saved benchmarks and the selected customer labor-rate input. ",
