                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Business Outcome and Discussion Prompt are discussion-guide text informed by published generative-AI research, not measured KPIs - they're meant to spark a conversation, not to be read as your organization's actual results. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Take action: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1B1F27"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "start with the real columns to see where usage concentrates, then use Business Outcome and Discussion Prompt to open a conversation with that team about whether usage is producing the outcome you'd expect.",
